  "disclosures": [
    "the MP4 samples one frame every 10 tu and the GIF every 20 tu; the circler turns about 95 degrees per tu, so its pose from frame to frame is not continuous motion",
    "the film holds its last frame for two seconds",
    "twins are our own draws of HR-009's recipe (noise U(-1,1) x 1e-12 on cells within 3 of the seed's support) in alm.lenia; they are not HR-009's or Lane 6's runs, and their death times are not expected to match those runs'",
    "12 runs show spread, not a lifetime distribution; HR-009 pools 37 runs",
    "all runs are at R 13, T 10 on a 128x128 grid; L3-003 (PR #29 @ 8c3c082) finds no deaths in 29 runs at R 26 (to 5000-8000 tu), 3 at R 39 (8000 tu), 24 at R 13 T 20 or 24 at R 13 T 40 (8000 tu each), so the finite lifetime is specific to the R 13, T 10 discretization",
    "GIF palette reduced to 128 colours; the MP4 is H.264 (lossy)"
  ],
